WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:04.400
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.530 --> 00:07.560
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.070 --> 00:10.810
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.810 --> 00:15.440
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.880 --> 00:22.840
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.590 --> 00:27.460
Dragon Drive

00:27.460 --> 00:32.950
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.090 --> 00:36.060
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.060 --> 00:39.300
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.800 --> 00:44.170
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.170 --> 00:46.140
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.140 --> 00:52.440
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.180 --> 00:56.550
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.550 --> 00:59.750
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.090 --> 01:05.090
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.090 --> 01:06.650
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.800 --> 01:09.200
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.200 --> 01:12.330
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.730 --> 01:17.810
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.810 --> 01:20.540
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.540 --> 01:28.210
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:49.400 --> 01:51.570
Make sure you hit the target, Chibi!

01:54.610 --> 01:56.130
Missed again?!

01:56.210 --> 01:58.300
Don't blame your dragon!

01:58.710 --> 02:02.340
You're missing because you're frightened
by the immense power produced!

02:04.150 --> 02:06.380
Trust your dragon's abilities!

02:07.320 --> 02:09.850
Because... I'm frightened?

02:10.460 --> 02:11.790
One more time.

02:11.890 --> 02:13.260
I'm counting on you, Chibi!

02:18.770 --> 02:20.230
GO!!

02:26.270 --> 02:29.680
Labyrinth of Darkness

02:53.400 --> 02:56.600
If only I could get rid of this guy...

02:56.800 --> 02:58.770
Shinryu would be mine.

03:07.220 --> 03:08.510
What are you doing?! Get outta my way!

03:08.850 --> 03:09.940
Calm down!

03:10.120 --> 03:12.250
It's not a foe that you can defeat alone!

03:12.590 --> 03:15.520
We don't know that until we try, do we?!
Outta my way!

03:15.590 --> 03:18.490
What's going on?
Why is he getting so hot-headed?!

03:18.730 --> 03:20.220
Calm down, Daisuke!

03:20.460 --> 03:24.560
I'm gonna defeat this one,
no matter what it takes!

03:36.440 --> 03:37.640
Daisuke!

03:40.950 --> 03:42.470
You can't do it alone!

03:43.220 --> 03:44.650
We've got no choice!

03:47.020 --> 03:48.280
Stay back, Daisuke!

03:48.790 --> 03:50.280
How can we help him without hurting him?

04:04.770 --> 04:06.170
That's right.

04:07.710 --> 04:10.300
As long as I get my hands on Shinryu...

04:31.070 --> 04:32.090
Reiji!

04:32.630 --> 04:33.600
Rockaku!

04:33.670 --> 04:34.830
Sorry I'm late!

04:35.540 --> 04:36.830
Huh? Isn't that?

04:37.070 --> 04:38.470
Oh, Hikaru.

04:38.540 --> 04:41.570
He's agreed to join us,
and fight on our side.

04:42.010 --> 04:43.270
Is that so.

04:43.340 --> 04:44.780
Then what are we waiting for?!

04:45.310 --> 04:46.300
You're right!

04:57.260 --> 04:58.730
What's wrong, Chibi?

04:59.630 --> 05:00.690
Oh, of course.

05:03.360 --> 05:06.460
You're exhausted after using SinnSaber.

05:11.010 --> 05:12.670
Sorry, Chibi.

05:12.740 --> 05:16.230
I'd like to let you rest,
but we're still not done with this battle.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.070
Go and get some rest!

05:19.510 --> 05:21.410
Rockaku. But...

05:21.850 --> 05:23.340
Leave the rest to us!

05:23.550 --> 05:25.950
We'll keep them occupied until you return.

05:26.350 --> 05:27.750
Trust us!

05:30.330 --> 05:31.660
Thank you, Rockaku!

05:31.860 --> 05:33.760
Well, get going!

05:34.230 --> 05:35.200
Mhm!

05:45.170 --> 05:45.870
It's coming.

05:45.940 --> 05:46.930
What?!

05:48.940 --> 05:50.210
We'll just have to defeat it.

05:50.280 --> 05:51.710
You don't have to tell me that!

05:59.590 --> 06:01.350
Darn. What a pest!

06:09.160 --> 06:11.460
Hideaki! Don't just watch!
Help me out here!

06:13.900 --> 06:14.990
That brat.

06:22.310 --> 06:24.140
Roger, Father.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.690
Come on!

06:33.820 --> 06:36.380
Dad will be angry with you...

06:36.460 --> 06:37.920
...if you don't take better care of me!

06:37.990 --> 06:39.320
What about Mahiru?

06:39.690 --> 06:41.490
He's probably somewhere fooling around.

06:41.560 --> 06:43.550
Who cares. Forget about that guy!

06:44.470 --> 06:45.490
Okay.

06:45.700 --> 06:47.170
You're quite something, big brother.

06:48.770 --> 06:50.400
How far do you plan to go?

06:51.210 --> 06:52.640
This should be far enough.

06:53.010 --> 06:54.300
What?

06:55.510 --> 06:57.140
Why won't it follow us?

06:57.480 --> 07:01.810
The Four Sacred Dragons will not attack
if we keep a distance from the Shrine.

07:02.120 --> 07:05.640
After all, the dragons' duty
is to protect the Shrine.

07:05.990 --> 07:08.890
Oh, is that so?
You sure know a lot about this.

07:09.260 --> 07:10.990
You knew too, didn't you, brother?

07:11.060 --> 07:12.920
Let's leave the fighting to the others.

07:13.090 --> 07:17.120
I'm sure Father will be pleased
with our efficient battle strategy.

07:17.970 --> 07:21.920
Dad's given this game's strategy guide
to Hideaki only.

07:23.370 --> 07:27.360
That's okay, I just need to use that
to my advantage.

07:27.680 --> 07:30.410
Besides, this makes the game
more interesting!

07:39.390 --> 07:41.910
What is that filthy feather?

07:42.460 --> 07:45.260
This feather belongs to
Kouhei Toki's dragon.

07:45.930 --> 07:46.890
No way!

07:46.960 --> 07:49.330
It doesn't look like it was plucked recently.

07:49.600 --> 07:52.730
He must've come to Rikyu long ago.

07:53.100 --> 07:55.730
Long before what we're dealing with now.

07:57.340 --> 08:00.170
Kouhei Toki's the one you want revenge on
for the death of your friend, right?

08:00.640 --> 08:02.730
Yeah. I finally found him!

08:03.410 --> 08:05.710
From this point on, I'm gonna do as I wish!

08:06.250 --> 08:10.980
You saw my brother die,
and casually came back alive!

08:11.720 --> 08:13.240
Rockaku's friend...

08:13.350 --> 08:14.750
Mahiru's brother...

08:15.020 --> 08:15.990
Vengeance...

08:16.760 --> 08:18.250
I get it. It all makes sense now.

08:19.360 --> 08:21.190
K-Kyoji? Where to?

08:21.930 --> 08:24.090
I finally figured it out! We must hurry!

08:25.470 --> 08:26.430
Oh, my...

08:32.040 --> 08:35.630
Didn't you come here to get me?!

08:36.540 --> 08:40.280
Kyoji! Wait for me!

08:53.230 --> 08:55.560
You did it! Far out, Daisuke!

08:55.860 --> 08:57.560
But you're overdoing it!

08:57.870 --> 09:00.600
You've gotta trust our abilities a little more!

09:03.770 --> 09:05.100
Let's hurry to the Shrine.

09:05.170 --> 09:07.140
Right now, we should be able to get inside!

09:07.340 --> 09:11.370
Mhm! We should now be able to keep
the sealed Shinryu from Kouhei!

09:11.450 --> 09:12.470
Stop it.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.950
What are you saying, Daisuke?

09:15.020 --> 09:19.390
If we hesitate, Kouhei may come
and break Shinryu's seal!

09:19.450 --> 09:21.220
You know that, don't you?!

09:21.460 --> 09:25.820
Not a single soul shall be allowed to enter
the Shrine where Shinryu rests...

09:27.560 --> 09:28.820
...you fools!

09:36.400 --> 09:38.960
Wh-Why? What's going on?

09:39.570 --> 09:42.200
I thought that Sacred Dragon died!

09:43.210 --> 09:45.340
It's possessing Kanper!

09:45.450 --> 09:47.140
Not only Kanper.

09:47.210 --> 09:48.550
It's possessed Daisuke, too.

09:49.120 --> 09:51.980
Those of you here trying to open the door
that must not be opened...

09:52.120 --> 09:54.090
...shall pay for your sins.

10:21.150 --> 10:22.880
Where are we?

10:24.450 --> 10:25.890
What's going on?

10:27.120 --> 10:28.680
I don't like the looks of this.

10:31.630 --> 10:33.420
Let's hurry and find a way out.

10:33.660 --> 10:34.720
At this rate...

10:34.800 --> 10:36.020
It's no use.

10:37.570 --> 10:38.860
I won't let you out of here!

10:38.930 --> 10:40.420
No one is to move!

10:42.240 --> 10:43.600
D-Daisuke?!

10:44.240 --> 10:46.730
Why do you seek forbidden power?

10:47.210 --> 10:49.010
What's gotten into you, Daisuke?

10:49.740 --> 10:50.730
Answer me.

10:50.810 --> 10:52.800
Why do you choose the path to destruction?

10:52.880 --> 10:56.320
We're fighting so that the world
doesn't get destroyed!

10:56.450 --> 10:57.750
Have you forgotten?

10:57.990 --> 10:59.250
That's a lie.

10:59.320 --> 11:02.220
You people want to get your hands
on the powers of Shinryu.

11:02.790 --> 11:06.690
With Shinryu's power, you plan
to rebuild the world to your liking.

11:07.130 --> 11:08.990
Daisuke. Come to your senses!

11:09.130 --> 11:13.570
His soul has been taken over
by the dragon protecting the Shrine.

11:14.270 --> 11:15.500
Then we've gotta save him.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.570
Why don't you save him?

11:37.990 --> 11:39.720
Won't you ever quit?!

11:39.790 --> 11:41.960
That thing's so persistent!

11:46.970 --> 11:48.590
All the nuisances are gone.

11:49.500 --> 11:50.800
Let's go, brother.

11:57.310 --> 12:00.970
Secretly running off like this...
isn't my style after all.

12:03.450 --> 12:05.540
You fool! This was our chance!

12:06.890 --> 12:07.820
K-Kouhei!

12:10.660 --> 12:12.150
I won't let you get away this time!

12:12.430 --> 12:14.090
Why are you so hot-headed all the time?

12:14.300 --> 12:16.820
You know, you've got
no chance against me, old man.

12:17.230 --> 12:18.490
How dare you!

12:36.780 --> 12:38.620
Hideaki! Watch out!

12:42.720 --> 12:45.060
Kouhei! Why won't you follow the plan?!

12:45.290 --> 12:47.160
How dare you call me that!

12:47.230 --> 12:50.250
You're better off just doing as I say!

13:07.850 --> 13:08.820
Now!

13:18.660 --> 13:20.350
I hate thunder and lightning...

13:21.130 --> 13:23.260
...because I can't hear Father's voice.

13:39.210 --> 13:41.610
You're always leaving everything to others.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.650
You can't do a thing alone.

13:44.520 --> 13:44.850
What?

13:44.920 --> 13:48.880
You wanna get Shinryu
so that you can prove yourself, right?

13:49.420 --> 13:50.390
That's not true!

13:50.460 --> 13:52.290
I've been trying hard in my own way...

13:52.390 --> 13:54.920
You're lying. You're only following others.

13:55.760 --> 13:59.670
You're a coward, encouraging them to fight
while you stay back on safer grounds.

13:59.830 --> 14:00.960
You're wrong!

14:01.440 --> 14:04.130
There's no way you'd know how I feel!

14:05.240 --> 14:06.230
I do know.

14:06.310 --> 14:07.930
Because I'm you.

14:08.380 --> 14:11.340
No! It can't be true!

14:12.980 --> 14:14.950
Then prove it!

14:15.420 --> 14:18.610
Prove that you can fight like a true warrior!

14:19.390 --> 14:20.750
Maiko! Don't be deceived!

14:21.360 --> 14:23.720
It's not real! It's an illusion!

14:23.890 --> 14:24.980
You mustn't be tricked!

14:25.260 --> 14:26.320
That's right.

14:26.460 --> 14:30.450
It's a common saying
that one's biggest enemy is oneself.

14:32.100 --> 14:33.930
You're not being honest with yourself.

14:34.570 --> 14:37.870
You're powerless, but you talk
like you're still a big man.

14:41.280 --> 14:43.740
You really do look just like us.

14:44.040 --> 14:47.240
If you try to fool around with my mind,
you'll find it's harder than you expect!

14:47.510 --> 14:48.670
Stop bluffing.

14:48.780 --> 14:51.310
You call yourself
a Dragonic Heaven Champion?

14:51.620 --> 14:55.750
Then why are the ones fighting for Rikyu
mere youngsters from another world?

14:56.360 --> 14:59.090
I consider myself one of those fighting.

14:59.290 --> 15:01.260
- That's nothing but sophistry.
- What?!

15:01.700 --> 15:04.890
Are you satisfied,
deceiving yourself with such nonsense?

15:05.870 --> 15:07.090
What are you saying?

15:07.530 --> 15:09.590
What you really want is to obtain Shinryu...

15:09.700 --> 15:12.830
...so that people will see you
as a powerful warrior, right?

15:13.540 --> 15:14.730
That sure is harsh.

15:14.810 --> 15:17.000
You wanna see for yourself
how strong I am?

15:28.990 --> 15:30.510
You mustn't, Mr. Taiyou!

15:30.660 --> 15:32.630
But at least, he's a winner.

15:33.160 --> 15:35.290
On the other hand, I have nothing.

15:35.760 --> 15:38.130
Why not be honest,
and tell him how you envy him?

15:38.670 --> 15:40.220
What are you getting at?

15:40.900 --> 15:42.370
Don't you remember?

15:42.640 --> 15:44.570
There was once a guy
who could never beat Hikaru Himuro.

15:44.670 --> 15:48.040
So he switched to a block full of weaklings
to become a divisional champion.

15:48.340 --> 15:49.670
Sound familiar?

15:50.540 --> 15:53.040
On top of that,
your reason to come to Rikyu...

15:53.180 --> 15:54.440
...is to see a girl.

15:54.680 --> 15:55.610
Stop it!

15:55.680 --> 15:57.670
I'm trying to repay Miss L for her kindness!

15:57.920 --> 16:01.250
And you hope that by doing this,
she'll fall in love with you?

16:02.260 --> 16:03.550
Shut up!!

16:03.890 --> 16:05.650
Calm down, Ichirou!

16:07.490 --> 16:10.160
What right do you have
to tell others what to do?

16:10.900 --> 16:13.160
I'm the one who got everyone
involved in the first place.

16:13.270 --> 16:16.900
If it weren't for me,
none of this would've happened.

16:22.780 --> 16:24.070
How pathetic.

16:24.180 --> 16:28.080
You're all nothing but weaklings
with a desire for power.

16:28.380 --> 16:33.580
I cannot afford to let people like you
take advantage of Shinryu's powers.

16:45.300 --> 16:48.000
You shall be swallowed up
by the darkness within yourselves.

16:54.780 --> 16:56.770
Bastard! Where'd he go?!

16:57.440 --> 16:59.040
Right now, we should focus on that one.

17:14.530 --> 17:15.790
All right!

17:16.300 --> 17:17.960
Where're Kouhei and that little kid?

17:18.200 --> 17:20.030
We're not finished fighting the dragons yet.

17:20.100 --> 17:21.430
W-Wait! Hey!

17:24.140 --> 17:25.660
How pitiful.

17:25.740 --> 17:29.300
You fools seek powers without
giving thought to how worthy you are.

17:29.640 --> 17:32.440
You will not have Shinryu.
You shall disappear.

17:35.520 --> 17:38.540
Too bad Reiji didn't come to help.

17:39.250 --> 17:41.120
S-Stop underestimating me!

17:43.790 --> 17:46.620
I may be weak, but...

17:46.830 --> 17:49.690
...I've decided that I'm no longer
gonna rely on Reiji!

17:49.930 --> 17:52.160
I'm no longer the Maiko
who keeps counting on others!

17:52.470 --> 17:53.870
I've changed!

18:01.910 --> 18:04.000
Right. I had forgotten.

18:04.710 --> 18:08.610
I didn't realize it
until Maiko pointed it out.

18:08.750 --> 18:10.270
I should be ashamed of myself.

18:15.720 --> 18:18.090
I acknowledge it. It's like you say.

18:18.390 --> 18:21.620
Sure, I wanted to be respected
as a champion. But...

18:22.000 --> 18:23.190
...it's different now.

18:26.370 --> 18:29.560
I've been able to acquire greater strengths!

18:34.210 --> 18:35.570
Too bad for you.

18:40.650 --> 18:42.580
There's no limit to friendship power.

18:43.450 --> 18:44.880
Although I doubt you'd understand.

18:46.450 --> 18:47.940
I'm no longer alone...

18:48.290 --> 18:49.620
...unlike you!

18:55.930 --> 18:57.760
But can I be forgiven?

18:57.830 --> 19:02.060
Nobody would have gotten involved
in this battle if I hadn't come to Rikyu.

19:02.140 --> 19:06.160
Yes... you're right about that.

19:09.110 --> 19:12.670
RI-ON would've set their sights on Shinryu
whether you were here or not.

19:12.810 --> 19:14.010
It's not your fault.

19:14.080 --> 19:16.240
Besides, we're the only ones
capable of stopping RI-ON.

19:19.590 --> 19:20.610
I won't run away either.

19:21.160 --> 19:24.150
I'm the one who got everyone involved,
but I won't run away!

19:24.220 --> 19:26.280
I will see this through to the end. Disappear!

19:26.760 --> 19:28.490
N-No!

19:29.960 --> 19:31.260
Your efforts are futile.

19:31.900 --> 19:34.730
If you let the darkness swallow you,
you would have been at peace.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.230
You must be kidding!

19:36.300 --> 19:38.200
I prefer the tougher life!

19:38.610 --> 19:40.270
We'll have you return Daisuke to us!

19:40.610 --> 19:41.540
Not a chance!

19:53.850 --> 19:56.350
This person will be the first one
to go to the dark side.

19:58.260 --> 20:01.250
Everyone! Get outta here!

20:03.200 --> 20:07.000
I won't let a single soul get close to Shinryu!

20:17.540 --> 20:18.640
Damn it.

20:18.710 --> 20:20.810
Rockaku... How dare he make fun of me!

20:26.150 --> 20:28.820
Good, Chibi. You look a lot better now!

20:30.020 --> 20:30.990
Let's go!

20:44.200 --> 20:46.900
I finally get to meet the last item.

20:47.110 --> 20:48.070
Kouhei!

20:50.580 --> 20:51.670
Still another one left?

20:56.450 --> 20:59.180
Well, at least this makes it more exciting!

21:56.780 --> 21:59.440
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.510 --> 22:02.210
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.280 --> 22:06.220
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.690 --> 22:10.380
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.460 --> 22:12.620
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.090 --> 22:17.190
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.630 --> 22:21.230
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.300 --> 22:23.960
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.040 --> 22:28.000
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.340 --> 22:31.780
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.850 --> 22:34.780
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.850 --> 22:39.720
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.390 --> 22:43.050
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.120 --> 22:45.820
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.890 --> 22:50.520
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.260 --> 22:53.960
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.030 --> 22:56.630
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.700 --> 23:01.330
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.010 --> 23:06.500
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.450 --> 23:13.110
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.490 --> 23:17.980
Next time

23:18.560 --> 23:19.860
Oh, no!

23:19.930 --> 23:21.790
At this rate, Maiko and the others
will be defeated!

23:21.860 --> 23:23.330
I've gotta go and save them!

23:23.400 --> 23:24.160
Let's go!

23:24.230 --> 23:25.260
However...

23:25.330 --> 23:28.360
...Kouhei and I have gotten ourselves
locked up in this strange dimension!

23:28.440 --> 23:29.460
O-Oh, no!

23:29.540 --> 23:31.530
Huh?! What's going on?

23:31.610 --> 23:33.000
Kouhei's acting funny.

23:33.610 --> 23:36.340
What?! He wants to work together
to get outta here?!

23:36.410 --> 23:37.670
Really?!

23:38.010 --> 23:40.170
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Truth".

23:40.550 --> 23:42.220
Does this mean Kouhei
will join forces with us?

23:42.220 --> 23:43.080
The Truth
Does this mean Kouhei
will join forces with us?

23:43.080 --> 23:43.120
The Truth

23:43.120 --> 23:44.950
The Truth
Unbelievable!
